    - Diagnosis
    - Medication
    - Treatment
    - Physiotherapy
    - Exercise modifications
    - Recovery notes
    - Follow-up testing
    - Return to activity
  - Instead of remembering isolated events, BodyBrain remembers the entire episode.
- 14. Daily Fitness Memory
