- 16. Why fitness data matters medically
  - Fitness data should provide context, not clinical conclusions.
  - Example timeline:
    - Running volume increases
    - User reports leg symptoms
    - Doctor appointment
    - MRI performed
    - Specific finding documented
    - Treatment begins
    - Running volume decreases
    - Physiotherapy begins
    - User returns to running
  - BodyBrain can explain the timeline without pretending that activity data alone proves causation.
