- 18. Body Memory Graph
  - Underneath the timeline is a graph of relationships.
  - Example:
    - Person
    - → has → Right knee
    - → experienced → Pain
    - → following → Running increase
    - → evaluated during → Orthopedic appointment
    - → investigated by → MRI
    - → identified → Meniscus finding
    - → treated with → Physiotherapy
    - → associated with → Exercise modification
    - → followed by → Recovery
  - This graph is what allows the AI to answer questions requiring information from several different sources.
