- 21. Agent retrieval
  - A question such as:
    - "Tell me what happened with my lower back."
  - should trigger several retrieval paths:
    - Detect anatomy
    - Retrieve clinical records
    - Retrieve relevant imaging findings
    - Retrieve doctor discussions
    - Retrieve prescriptions
    - Retrieve symptoms
    - Retrieve related activity
    - Retrieve treatment/recovery events
    - Sort by chronology
    - Follow graph relationships
    - Generate answer with provenance
  - This is more powerful than basic vector RAG.
