- 26. Personal Digital Twin
  - The 3D model eventually becomes more than a generic anatomy viewer.
  - Version 1:
    - Generic anatomy + personal memories
  - Version 2:
    - Personal measurements + longitudinal health data
  - Version 3:
    - Personal medical imaging connected to anatomy
  - Version 4:
    - Patient-specific anatomical reconstruction
  - Version 5:
    - Physiological modeling
  - MONAI Physio is relevant to this longer-term direction because it is currently aimed at personalized physiological digital twins derived from 3D/4D medical images, including subject-specific physiological modeling. GitHub
